title: "V2X World"
abstract: "A deterministic, discrete-event simulator of connected-vehicle (V2X) systems: road traffic, the radio channel, the network, IEEE 1609.2 security and the US Security Credential Management System (SCMS), with attacks and misbehaviour detection."
